            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaazibula Balaamu amaiso, yaabona malaika wa Musengwa ng'ayemereire mu ngira, ng'asowoire empiima mu kiruutu kyayo yaagigema mu ngalo. Balaamu yaakutama n'ekyeni kyatuuka ku itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa Musengwa Katonda, yaabuuza Balaamu ati: “Lwaki okubye endogoyi yo emikuzi egyo esatu? Bona eno, ndidhye okwekiika mu ngira yo, kuba olugendo lwo luno tirusemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endogoyi yo emboine ku mikuzi egyo esatu, yanviirayo yaakyukira ku mbali. Era ngoli tekyusenga n'enviirayo, bwenebwene ngoli buti nkwise, yeene naagireka nga nnamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
