      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki bweyawulira nga Balaamu aidhie, yaaja okumusangaaza mu kibuga kya Moabu ekiri ku mbali kw'omwiga Arunoni, aghasemberayo irala ku nsalosalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki yaamukoba ati: “Lwaki tiwaidha, bwe nakwetesa omukuzi ogwasooka? Okoba oti tisobola kukuleetera kuba wa kitiibwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu yairamu Balaki ati: “Buti ndidhie. Aye obwo odhuuba oti ndi n'obukumu okuba ni kye ndhogera? Ekyo kyonka Katonda ky'andagira, kye nteekwa okwogera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Balaamu ni Balaki baaja, baatuuka mu kibuga Kiriathi Huzothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki yaaghaayo ente n'entaama ng'omusengo, era yaagheerezaaku Balaamu n'abakungu abaali naye emamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe bwakya enkyo, Balaki yaatwala Balaamu mu kifo ekigulumivu eky'okusinzizaamu e Bamothi Baali. Balaamu ng'ali eyo, yaabonaku abandi ku Baisiraeli abaamuli okumpi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
